  {"id":"..\\RvGame\\Localization\\INT\\RvGame.int|Tutorial|TMDGravity","category":"tutorial","en":"Press [grab] once to pick up an object.\n\nPress [grab] again to put the object down.","pl":"Naciśnij raz [grab], aby podnieść obiekt.\n\nNaciśnij ponownie [grab], aby go odłożyć.","status":"translated"},
