  {"id":"..\\RvGame\\Localization\\INT\\RvGame.int|Tutorial|TimeLock","category":"tutorial","en":"Press [grab] to pick up Deadlock.  Pull [fire] to activate Deadlock.","pl":"Naciśnij [grab], aby podnieść Deadlock.  Naciśnij [fire], aby go aktywować.","status":"translated"},
